# 🎯 Main Learning Principle

The project follows a simple architecture:

```text
Router
   ↓
Service
   ↓
Database
```

For AI features:

```text
Router
   ↓
AI Service
   ↓
Database Service
   ↓
PostgreSQL
```

The goal is not just to make the application work, but to understand **why each layer exists and how the pieces communicate**.

---

# 📌 Current Project Status

This project is primarily a **learning/prototype application built using production-oriented backend patterns**.

It demonstrates how:

- FastAPI handles APIs
- Pydantic validates data
- PostgreSQL stores application data
- asyncpg handles asynchronous database operations
- connection pooling improves database connection reuse
- middleware handles cross-cutting concerns
- authentication protects endpoints
- exception handlers provide consistent errors
- OpenAI understands natural-language requests
- PostgreSQL remains the source of truth
- Streamlit provides a simple frontend

The project can later be evolved into a production-grade **AI-powered backend / Agentic AI application**.